@startuml CreateReservation

actor Client
participant ReservationRouting
participant ReservationService
participant ReservationRepository
participant StatusPages
database H2

Client -> ReservationRouting : POST /reservations (ReservationRequest)
ReservationRouting -> ReservationService : createReservation(request)

alt starttijd in het verleden of eindtijd <= starttijd
    ReservationService --> StatusPages : ApiException(400)
    StatusPages --> Client : 400 Bad Request
end

ReservationService -> ReservationRepository : carExists(carId)
ReservationRepository -> H2
ReservationRepository --> ReservationService : Boolean
alt auto bestaat niet
    ReservationService --> StatusPages : ApiException(404)
    StatusPages --> Client : 404 Not Found
end

ReservationService -> ReservationRepository : userExists(userId)
ReservationRepository -> H2
ReservationRepository --> ReservationService : Boolean
alt gebruiker bestaat niet
    ReservationService --> StatusPages : ApiException(404)
    StatusPages --> Client : 404 Not Found
end

ReservationService -> ReservationRepository : hasActiveOverlap(carId, startTime, endTime)
ReservationRepository -> H2
ReservationRepository --> ReservationService : Boolean
alt tijdsblok al gereserveerd
    ReservationService --> StatusPages : ApiException(409)
    StatusPages --> Client : 409 Conflict
end

ReservationService -> ReservationRepository : createReservation(..., CONFIRMED)
ReservationRepository -> H2 : INSERT reservation
ReservationRepository --> ReservationService : Reservation
ReservationService --> ReservationRouting : Reservation
ReservationRouting --> Client : 201 Created

@enduml
